# MARPOL Offline Navigator

A small offline-first PWA for MARPOL compliance, route checking, and offline chart review at sea.

## Features
- Offline navigation and compliance checks
- Route import from CSV, Excel, RTZ, RTZP
- MARPOL / ECA area detection with a local point-in-polygon engine
- Vessel simulator and printable report generation
- Portable static web app and installable PWA
- Local persistence with export/import

## Run locally

```bash
python3 -m http.server 8000
```

Then open `http://localhost:8000` in a browser.

## Notes
- Works without internet after first load
- Uses local data kept on-device
- Chart data can be refreshed when connectivity is available

## Files
- `index.html` — app shell
- `styles.css` — theme and layout
- `manifest.json` — PWA metadata
- `service-worker.js` — offline caching
- `js/` — engine, route logic, simulator, and UI handlers

